<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JON" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">JONAH</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc2">JONAH</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jon</para>
  <para style="mt1">JONAH</para>
  <para style="mt2">Jonah</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">Jonah ccauh hynh Baebu kya umpaw ccangpaw profeh ccauh hae te lokuh khyh; pawccecize e ccauh kyahin Bawipaw bya a ngae leipaw profeh nynh a cyisahnaw kong kha a ho. Pachia nynh Jonah kha Israel rhaw athuapaw Assiria khuapi Nineveh khua lang ccia lan a naw. Thuasalama Jonah nynh cceih ry khyh, Pachia nynh Nineveh khua ka roh cih a cipaw hynh roh tali lan khyh cite a zyn. A tungvaw kya aphuinphuin acyihkuh koute a ry lei pite Pachia kaw kha a ngae; nyathyakou tuh ronaw kong a hopaw kha acyiku khyh keiccuze a lunghoy khyh.</para>
  <para style="ip">E ccauh nynh Pachia tuh a raepaw balyn tungvaw kya uktu nynh thua cipaw kha a langsah. Pachia tuh sungsahnaw te thawccinaw Pachia thua zah, a ccungccaw hae rhaw kha heize detah te ro laeze mih seinaw ngaethya te khum kha a ryhua cipaw a langsaku.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Jonah konaw te kaw-einaw 1.1-17</para>
  <para style="io1">Jonah a ngaesikunaw te a luenaw 2.1-10</para>
  <para style="io1">Nineveh kya Jonah a hopaw bya 3.1-10</para>
  <para style="io1">Nineveh tungvaw Pachia thawccinaw 4.1-11</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia kyate Ccue lan A Zuaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Amittai ccapaw Jonah kya yn thua zah:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:25">2Si 14.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nineveh khuapi kalan khe cceih kangmaw lah, siatua; pawccecize mih hoyleinaw tuh ka malang phe yn thua vae,” a ci. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama Janah tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate ccue khylan Tarshish khua lang a thokuh. Joppa khua lang cceihbung zah Tarshish khua lang a cceih cih paw sanphalung ccangkheit kha a muih; sanphalung ccikunaw mee kha pya zah sanphalung vawlan a kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate asawkunaw lang minmin ryte Tarshish khua lang a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh myarya rupaw khisan kha rili vawlan zawsah zah, rili vawlan khe athawsaepaw khise tuh tho zah, sanphalung tuh vyavya aroh vae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh sanphalung kya ryalahtu hae tuh rih hae zah, mih pachia raveih kalan a sia hae. Sanphalung tuh azawhua ccaw cite a lungkhu e uccaw hae kha rili lungkhu lang a vua hae. Tuh lyatuin Jonah tuh sanphalung alia khaan ane huanaw langkhe rungbung zah zya a ih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Sanphalung bawipaw nynh yn cceih zah, “Pawccemou thuhbabi lan na i? Thokuh lah, na pachia kalan sawsang! Na pachia nynh aening ah chi khyh nawlan oh tuapyate oun luesah kho khaw,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sanphalung kya ryalahtu hae nynh, “Rang oh, e vawsawnaw hynh ahum keiccu mou ah tung oh cipaw ny nawlan ccungthyhdung oh sih,” cite a hoku hae. Ccungthyhdung hae zah, Jonah tungvaw accah. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tetuh minmin nynh Jonah kha, “E vawsawnaw hynh pawccemou aening tungvaw accaw, oun hopya tua. Paw rya mou na law? Tei kyate mou nae thua? Tei ram paw mou na thua? Paw minphuin mou na thua?” a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kae tuh Hebru ccungccaw nynh ka thua, rili te laephi a raetupaw vaaw Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beikpaw nynh ka thua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh minmin tuh myarya rih hae zah, “Pawccemou hynhte na cyi?” cite a khia hae. Pawccecize Jonah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate a ccuepaw kha a hopya vae hae keiccuze minmin nynh a ny vae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te rili tuileih tuh houhouh atho keiccuze minmin nynh Jonah kha, “Rili tuileih adae nawlan nang hynh pawtemou kae cyih cih?” a cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Jonah nynh minmin kha, “Kae hynh yn hang oh lah, rili lungkhu lang yn vua oh; tetuh rili tuh zya adae vae cih; pawccecize e athawsaepaw khise na tung oh paw hynh kae ka keiccu nynh thua cipaw ka ny,” a cipya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Sanphalung kya ryalahtu hae nynh varang lang a thua ccaw cite sanphalung kha thawte a zaw hae, thuasalama khise tuh houhouh atho keiccuze cyih kho khyh hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sia hae zah, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, e ccungccapaw hiinnaw keiccuze kaening hynh beih oun theih nan, seinaw a hoi leipaw chiise keiccuze kae tungvaw kya seinaw kha beih khang nan. Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang tuh na ry hawte na cyi, cite saw kae sang,” a ci hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Jonah kha hang hae zah rili lungkhu lang a vua hae; tetuh rili tuileih tuh zya adae vae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te sanphalung kya ryalahtu hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha houh rih hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan silawnaw rae hae zah, byakinkunaw kha a rae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jonah kha po laang khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ngasawpi tuh kawpya zah, Jonah tuh ngasaw vue lungkhu khe nin thum te zi thum a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mat 12.40</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jonah Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jonah nynh ngasaw vue lungkhu te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia kalan saw a sang:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka vawsawnaw lungkhu te</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ka ko zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh yn leih;</para>
  <para style="q1">Michi khua lungkhu te ka sia zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka roi kha nae thaepya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Akhunaw, rili ngaelung langkhe</para>
  <para style="q2">nae vua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tui alepaw nynh kae kha yn koihlu;</para>
  <para style="q1">na tuileih hae te nae tuiphue tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka vawlan khe popo alua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh kae nynh, ‘Kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na muihnaw kyate vua ka thua vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawtemou na beikinn thyaapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">bua ka muih ung cih?’ ka ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tui nynh yn husung zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">akhupaw rili nynh yn koihlu;</para>
  <para style="q1">rili lungkhu e lonua hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka lu kha yn voi hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mua hae leihpaw langkhe</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rungbung zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a koikua ccong a khaw</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzaepaw ram kya ka thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhzemah, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hiinnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">Hunghuapi lungkhu kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">poh nae thuaa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hiinnaw vyavya athang lyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ka liathui;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka sawsangnaw tuh namaw kalan,</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaapaw na beikinn lungkhu lang a thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccungkia leipaw zohtuh kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a beik hae paw nynh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ahmepaw mih lungzinaw kha a vua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama kae nynh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuanaw roisawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">namaw kalan silawnaw ka rae cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">pya lan bya ka kinku vae paw kha ka pya cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Luenaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">nynh thua!” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ngasaw kha hopah zah, ngasaw nynh Jonah kha laerou kyakhe moh a lua vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Nineveh Lungpaleihkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Jonah kalan vae ningnaw yn thua zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Thokuh lah, Nineveh khuapi kalan cciatua, kae hopyapaw bya kha siakhae tua,” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jonah tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte Nineveh khua lang a cceih. Nineveh tuh myaryamaw alepaw khuapi thua zah, a lungkhu kya nin thum laanccia acih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonah tuh khuapi lungkhu lang tee zah, nin kheit he a cceih te, “Nin sung pali aro koute Nineveh khuapi tuh aroh cih!” cite a sia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:41">Mat 12.41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:32">Luk 11.32</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Nineveh khuaccaaw hae tuh Pachia a zyn hae; looh-aesung lanpaw kha thaesakuh hae zah, adih ale ccungccaw miakaw nynh buriboei kha a zingku hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e bya tuh Nineveh siapharan nynh he a thae te, a bawitungkhung kyate thokuh zah a angkiccua kha a khahku, buriboei kha zingkuh zah buhhaw kya a haung. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tetuh aning nynh Nineveh khua kya thaesahnaw rae zah: “Nineveh siapharan te a kuihkaw e bawi hae nynh kaw a tho hae paw tuh: Ccungccaw nynh thuasah, sahiin nynh thuasah, vaetua phu, tuuphu nynh thuasah looh papin ae lan khyh. Looh na ae lan khyh oh, tui mah na neih lan khyh oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccungccaw te sahiin hae nynh buriboei na zingkuh cih oh zah, Pachia kalan thawte saw na sang cih oh. Nanning balyn nynh ahoy leipaw nae ziazae kyate thuasah, puathote rya na law oh paw kyate thuasah na paleihkuh cih oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aening ah chi khyh nawlan oh, Pachia tuh a tuanaw paleihkuh zah myarya a thinrianaw kha adae kho, dae kho khyh cipaw hummou a nyh kho?” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin nynh ahoy leipaw mih ziazae kyate paleihkuh hae zah a cyi hae paw kha Pachia nynh he a muih te, minmin tungvaw thuasah lan a ho vae paw vawsawnawpi kong kha Pachia nynh a lungpaleihkuh zah, tuh-e tuh cyih vae khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jonah Thinrianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tetuh Jonah tuh myarya a lunghoy khyh zah a thinria. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sawsang zah, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, ka ram kya ka um lya mawte, ka hopaw kha e hynh thua khyh tou? Atakaw lya Tarshish khua lang ka ccuepaw kha hynh-e keiccu nynh thua; nang tuh thawccih thyapaw Pachia, ngaethyaumsah thyapaw, a lungsaepaw, atynpaw sungsahnaw a hoipaw te detah lanpaw kyate a lungpaleihkuh thyapaw nynh na thua cipaw ka ny.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Exo 34.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, ka hiinnaw hynh beih yn lawtua, ka hanlan hiin laeze chi ahoyhua,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:4">1Si 19.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Na thinriapaw hynh ahmepaw thua zawtou?” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh Jonah tuh khuapi kyate toikuh zah khuapi nithua langkhe a haung, te tuin kyakhe bu kha a sakku. Tuh-e bu mynlyh kaw khe haung zah, khuapi tuh pawtemah yn cyiku cipaw muih khylan phang a ngaw. <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh Jonah kha a lungdae ccaw cite a lu luki kya mynzia umsah khylan tui-ung ku kha Jonah luki khe a umsah; tetuh tuh-e tui-ung ku liate Jonah tuh myarya a lungtua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama awkhualan awkhua takaw khe, Pachia nynh tuh-e tui-ung ku tuh ripaw aesah zah baleih anaan. <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuanin he yn thua te, Pachia nynh nithua lang e asopaw khisan kha zawsah zah, Jonah lu kha khuanin nynh a e keiccuze a thawbang zah a chi nawlan a ngiaku. Jonah nynh, “Ka hanlan hiin laeze chi tuh ahoyhua,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jonah kha Thuiheite Penaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia nynh Jonah kha, “Tui-ung ku keiccuze na thinriapaw hynh ahmepaw athua zawtou?” a cipya. Te Jonah nynh, “Athua, phe chi lan cia mawte ka thinria,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Nang nynh tui-ung ku te asekuhte thawbangte rya na lah khyh zah na lesah thung kho khyh; zi kheit lungkhu yn um zah zi kheit lungkhu arohpaw tui-ung ku kha na thindae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Mih ranglang kuih te mih voilang kuih alaenaw san a nyhthya lei hae paw ccungccaw cciing kheit thong kuin lae te sahiin patae nynh mah a umnaw hae paw Nineveh khuapi kong kha kae nynh thindae lan ccan khyh tou?” a cipya.</para>
</usx>